### 0. 가입 (이미 있으면 500이 나도 괜찮음)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "otter1", "password": "password123" }

### 1. 로그인 → 응답의 token을 자동으로 저장
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "otter1", "password": "password123" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 2. 점수 제출 (토큰의 userId = otter1 로 저장됨)
POST http://localhost:8080/scores
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "score": 12500 }

### 3. 더 낮은 점수 → 갱신 안 됨
POST http://localhost:8080/scores
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "score": 5000 }

### 4. 랭킹 조회 (토큰 필요 없음)
GET http://localhost:8080/rankings?limit=10

### 5. 토큰 없이 제출 → 거부
POST http://localhost:8080/scores
Content-Type: application/json

{ "score": 99999 }

### 6. 가짜 토큰 → 거부
POST http://localhost:8080/scores
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer fake.token.value

{ "score": 99999 }

### 7. body에 userId를 넣어도 무시됨 (토큰 주인인 otter1로 저장)
POST http://localhost:8080/scores
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "userId": "otter2", "score": 20000 }

### 8. 음수 점수 → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/scores
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{ "score": -999 }
